tps://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312373_1363239738226092_2106854729412937022_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZQetVOkTPHQQ7kNvwF1c9Pd&_nc_oc=AdrYS6PbuFVkaDYNfvQR-wP01m6GREPPo8G-1rpWjU4Y3RmsT5dC8uysqL6HlVJROrs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDGLNLUYa3Szox2DmUxmbgCMhY7mR8qY3uBNkPzVK-9dQ&oe=6A6B406E"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image_02.png", "id": "1188201992987967", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295509_1188201996321300_2111120103698102006_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D6dpmypjjdsQ7kNvwF-O5rH&_nc_oc=AdrTX13TLngNCrBh8GwPnjKRm86bXh_5Xxv6sa1SUqaPu_KvG-RBGeFbbi-WOby34P0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD6uC3awXQehOtqGjzZUSCdRdMyHnh3rM-52A2jkR2Deg&oe=6A6B6D0A"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image_02.png", "id": "1737987487068873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295801_1737987493735539_1039395962667216685_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0Jy-kFBjsCsQ7kNvwHBNk-P&_nc_oc=Adrpo8kSxaRZLXvxOtj6AAP-BVBGttNtdlkw2Hyh2GOH1ObdHt355ReFQUKrewm-z3c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAh8bQtV_Vj7TJeT8jIIhFvL4-gIaWzHLIh8t1zhGPecw&oe=6A6B5C2B"}, {"file_name": "DodgeLasers_02.png", "id": "3637904013182167", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294007_3637904023182166_4032639804070807573_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YtFZFxfeDVMQ7kNvwGGo9Jv&_nc_oc=AdprdwGcKnlY-weS7uh4BvvJUpD_cqqfW2l9xRzxAjFBdByK0QVxWCLk16TmpTo0H7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCu0XqtCaSzmhnNVvhKF_hcOeOCBzi8c1HII4MR5FBrbA&oe=6A6B4931"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Landscape_New.png", "id": "898823102474350", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299808_898823109141016_4587002048357409884_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KsnECMCScqMQ7kNvwHMqQUu&_nc_oc=AdqLajv0PVMeS1m08jBEKk1cTEtvDCHc_vUg8dWSNoP12UGYaar99GwDz4bvZyg6gBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCSJ-ula9h3qPSL99dwe5SenPK6Cb3pTkGYaaM5Nsoxew&oe=6A6B48F8"}, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Punch Bomb\nis a fast-paced 360\u00b0 action arcade game where you punch bombs away before they explode.\n\nBuilt for those who love a challenge.\n\nClimb the global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Classic Mode\nSurvive as long as you can! Punch a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, dodge dangerous laser obstacles, hit targets, and rack up huge combos.\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRace against the clock to get a high score within the time limit! Bombs no longer explode, and targets extend your time. \n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock unique cosmetics by **playing the game** and mastering its challenges. Each cosmetic has its own visual flair!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Punch bombs away from you before they explode while racking up combos, dodging dangerous laser obstacles, and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_priv